      ],
      "text": "was performed after culture conversion. This effect was not observed in patients who underwent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.433349609375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "pneumonectomy. There are several important caveats to these data. Substantial bias is likely to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.386474609375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "present, because only patients judged to be fit for surgery would have been operated on. No patient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993597984313965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4024047851562,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "with HIV coinfection in the aIPD underwent lung resection surgery. Therefore, the effects of surgery",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.1616821289062,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "among PLHIV with MDR-TB could not be evaluated. Rates of death did not differ significantly between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968605041503906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.1345825195312,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "those who underwent surgery and those who received medical treatment only. However, the outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949233055114746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.3651123046875,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "could be biased because the risk of death could have been much higher among patients in whom",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        326.8096923828125,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "surgery was prescribed had they not been operated on.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.60794067382812,
        209.15652465820312,
        203.45993041992188
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.6678009033203,
        527.391357421875,
        225.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "The relative benefits of surgery are expected to depend substantially on the population subgroups",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.86793518066406,
        527.3717651367188,
        238.31092834472656
      ],
      "text": "that are targeted. The analysis could not provide a refined differentiation of the type of patient who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.0679473876953,
        527.4788208007812,
        251.5109405517578
      ],
      "text": "would be best suited to benefit from the intervention or the type of intervention that would have the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999850273132324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        250.26783752441406,
        527.4375610351562,
        264.7108459472656
      ],
      "text": "most benefit. The effect is expected to be moderate in the average patient considered appropriate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.46783447265625,
        527.4407958984375,
        277.9108581542969
      ],
      "text": "for surgery. The odds of success for patients with XDR-TB (pre-2021 definition) were statistically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.66778564453125,
        527.428955078125,
        291.1108093261719
      ],
      "text": "significantly lower when they underwent surgery compared with other patients (aOR: 0.4, 95% CL:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.8677978515625,
        527.3776245117188,
        304.3108215332031
      ],
      "text": "0.2–0.9). This effect is likely to be biased, given that patients who underwent surgery would have had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993597984313965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.06781005859375,
        417.9767150878906,
        317.5108337402344
      ],
      "text": "other factors predisposing to poor outcomes that could not be adjusted for.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.885009765625,
        245.23455810546875,
        346.73699951171875
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.9449157714844,
        527.4420776367188,
        368.387939453125
      ],
      "text": "Partial lung resection for patients with MDR-TB is to be considered only under conditions of good",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.14501953125,
        511.62408447265625,
        381.5880432128906
      ],
      "text": "surgical facilities and trained and experienced surgeons, and with careful selection of candidates.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.96221923828125,
        220.46530151367188,
        410.814208984375
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.0220947265625,
        527.3837890625,
        432.4651184082031
      ],
      "text": "The rates of death in the IPD for surgical outcomes did not differ significantly between patients who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.22210693359375,
        527.4365844726562,
        445.6651306152344
      ],
      "text": "underwent surgery and those who received medical treatment only. There were not enough data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.422119140625,
        527.442138671875,
        458.8651428222656
      ],
      "text": "on adverse events, surgical complications or long-term sequelae – some of which may be fatal –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.6221008300781,
        527.4388427734375,
        472.06512451171875
      ],
      "text": "to allow a meaningful analysis. Despite the unknown magnitude of perioperative complications, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.8221130371094,
        356.42950439453125,
        485.26513671875
      ],
      "text": "GDG assumed that, overall, there is a net benefit from surgery.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
